    "short_description": "Blast off in a 2D metroidvania adventure bursting with platforming thrills, deep exploration, and explosive action. Assemble a crack team of heroes to save the world in Blast Brigade!",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201c<strong>This gorgeously-presented side-scrolling shooter is a heck of a lot of fun. Even when it\u2019s testing your skill \u2013 and your patience.</strong>\u201d<br>7/10 \u2013 \ud83d\udd79\ufe0fGameSpew<br><br>\u201c<strong>Blast Brigade is still a terrific Metroidvania, and one of the best we've played outside of the very tippy-top tier.</strong>\u201d<br>8/10 \u2013 \ud83d\udd79\ufe0fNintendo Life<br><br>\u201c<strong>If like me, you\u2019re a fan of tight gunplay, rewarding exploration, and things stuffed with 80\u2019s charm, then you\u2019ll likely consider Blast Brigade to be twenty hours of your time well spent.</strong>\u201d<br>4/5 \u2013 \ud83d\udd79\ufe0fHey Poor Player<br>",
